    explanation: '<p><strong>Diketahui:</strong></p><ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-2"><li>Waktu awal (W1) = 45 menit = <sup>3</sup>&frasl;<sub>4</sub> jam</li><li>Jarak (J) = 30 km</li></ul><p>Pertama, cari kecepatan awal (K):</p><p class="pl-4">30 km = K x <sup>3</sup>&frasl;<sub>4</sub> jam<br>K = 30 x <sup>4</sup>&frasl;<sub>3</sub> = 40 km/jam</p><p class="mt-2">Karena dia terlambat 15 menit, maka waktu tersisa (W2) adalah 45 - 15 = 30 menit = <sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>2</sub> jam.</p><p>Gunakan konsep <strong>perbandingan berbalik nilai</strong> (semakin sedikit waktu, semakin tinggi kecepatan):</p><div class="overflow-x-auto my-2"><table class="w-full max-w-sm border border-gray-300 text-center"><thead class="bg-[#800000] text-white"><tr><th class="border px-4 py-2">Waktu</th><th class="border px-4 py-2">Kecepatan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border px-4 py-2"><sup>3</sup>&frasl;<sub>4</sub> jam</td><td class="border px-4 py-2">40 km/jam</td></tr><tr><td class="border px-4 py-2"><sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>2</sub> jam</td><td class="border px-4 py-2"><strong>?</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Perhitungannya:</p><p class="pl-4"><sup>3</sup>&frasl;<sub>4</sub> x 40 = <sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>2</sub> x K<br>30 = <sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>2</sub> K<br>K = 30 x 2 = <strong>60 km/jam</strong></p><p class="mt-2"><strong>Jalur Tikung (Cara Cepat):</strong><br>Karena jarak tetap (30 km) dan waktu yang diminta adalah <sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>2</sub> jam, maka:<br>Kecepatan = Jarak : Waktu<br>Kecepatan = 30 : <sup>1</sup>&frasl;<sub>2</sub> = 30 x 2 = <strong>60 km/jam</strong>.</p>',
